# Cloudflare Pages / Workers static assets.
# Next.js `output: "export"` copies public/ into the publish directory (out/).
# Patterns are extension-only so HTML routes under /blog are not cached for a year.
# `*` matches across slashes, including /film/m/* and /_next/static/chunks/*.

/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/blog/*.avif
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/blog/*.gif
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
